      ],
      "years": [
        2015,
        2023
      ],
      "text": "Under-five mortality declined in all three countries from 2015 to 2023: 14.29% in Japan, 15.82% in Kenya, 22.84% in Mexico. These are relative reductions, not percentage-point changes."
    }
